--TEST--
a constructor call is arity-checked like any other call, and the extra argument is reported at the call site
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Box {
    public int $n;

    public function constructor(int $n) {
        $this->n = $n;
    }
}
var $b = new Box(1, 2);
echo $b->n, "\n";
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0402]: expected 1 argument(s), found 2
  --> case.nvs:9:10
%A
error: aborting due to 1 error
To read what a code means and how to fix it, run `nvs agent show <code>`.
